<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Monday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.18</p>
<p> -		   Nov 29--5.16</p>
<p> -		    Dec 5--5.18</p>
<p> -	    Dec 9,18,27--5.17</p>
<p> -		Dec 20-22--5.17</p>
<p> -		Jan 14,21--5.17</p>
<p> -		   Feb 26--5.15</p>
</text>
